msgctxt "Nabbit1-shipLog"
msgid "[%s in sector %s] Engineer Dan McNabbit requests a ride to Armstrong"
msgstr "[%s en el sector %sEl ingeniero Dan McNabbit pide un paseo a Armstrong"

